/*
 * File documentation for the kernel sources of the Detailed Design that carry
 * no @file block of their own. Doxygen generates no page for an undocumented
 * file, so its functions outside every group would be in the XML (and get an
 * impl need) but have no HTML page to link to. Kept here, not in the source,
 * so the zephyr tree stays unchanged.
 */

